      "review_summary": "The branch extracts package-manager exec unwrapping into a shared infra parser and uses it to bind allow-always persistence and allowlist matching to inner commands while adding regression tests.\n\nPR surface: Source +146, Tests +363. Total +509 across 9 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source level: current main's shared allow-always path handles generic exec wrappers but not package-manager exec wrappers, while node-host had a separate package-manager parser for mutable operand binding. I did not run a live approval repro.",
